  "notes": {
    "1": "I'm planning a product offsite for December with 15 attendees and a $7,500 all-in budget approved by Joaquin; format is two days, one night. I've requested all-in quotes from Orrriholm Retreat and Galetal Retreat, including vegetarian options; Orrriholm said they'd send numbers next week and mentioned their barn seats up to 40. There's a calendar hold for the offsite with dates to confirm with Joaquin. Joaquin advised checking whether venues can arrange coach transport from the office, as it's often the biggest surprise in quotes; this is preliminary guidance, not confirmed.",
